: "Hello! I really like your work, I hope I can ask you to draw a picture for my original characters ( ´ ▽ ` )ノ 💕\n\nThe girl with white hair is a high school student, she's the youngest sister, very cute and lively. She loves her big brother and often fights with him.\nThe man with black hair is the second brother, he looks cold, but he is a good-hearted person, but a little arrogant. He likes his big brother, but doesn't dare to say so.\nThe man with white hair is the eldest brother, he is a gentle man, but also the head of the family, when his younger siblings are in conflict, he will be in the middle to coordinate them.\n\nI would like you to draw a picture of a family living in harmony! You can play with the content of the picture yourself, thanks again very much! Thank you again!\n\nHere is the reference link:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-517svRew6K9jssKOPh2cUCikHt-ClMp\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-517svRew6K9jssKOPh2cUCikHt-ClMp", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 1746351, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d054b955bf5b482ed1d888654227f91", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d054b955bf5b482ed1d888654227f91, https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c97ad0140961274bb54485e4332627c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=268ed7ffef9e2eef054e223759eba21c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3c03eaad367b0c43fa703393019ea885", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3c03eaad367b0c43fa703393019ea885, https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37708615a6bfdf3c82854128d298743f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64cc5394/uploads/origins/670c4bf8-bb72-42e2-894c-099f2ca702a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c4b27443cdb4121740bc92875ab6c2e 3x"}, "body": "ARI, nice to meet you! I like your work very much!\nI would like to ask you to illustrate two characters for me. The character introductions and references are summarized in the following information. If you have trouble seeing the details of the characters' costumes, you are free to omit the details or draw that part freely.\nhttps://imgur.com/a/wDKcd3b\nhttps://imgur.com/a/YoesuoU\nhttps://imgur.com/a/c46m6vJ\n\nCharacter introduction:\nThe character with white hair: aggressive (black eyes, height 180cm). Cool and manly, somewhat solitary and freedom loving. He is a warrior with high fighting ability. He uses two swords as weapons and shows his crazy side during battle. He is a ghost disguised as a pocket watch. He loves drinking and the moon.\nThe character with blue hair: Receiver (light gray eyes, height 179cm). He is kind and gentle, and sometimes teases people. He is somewhat idealistic. He is a military strategist with a high knowledge of tactics. He is a ghost disguised as a compass and has the ability to foretell the future. His hobbies are tea, writing, and giving candy to children who pass by. His wish is to have a good night's sleep.\n\nThe atmosphere when they are together:\n1. they feel connected, have an extraordinary understanding of the other, and maintain sufficient respect, but both want to have a deeper relationship with the other.\n2. you like the feeling that they are unconsciously approaching the other and that they are working hard toward the same goal.\nTheir relationship is more like that of a casual brother or an aged companion who has been married for many years than a sweet couple.\n\nI will leave the illustration up to you!\nBest regards!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7047da0a/uploads/origins/2fa00e9c-aed8-4704-b429-b91d29e062ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b163a79ef7fa2ce6a70e169c90be5763", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7047da0a/uploads/origins/2fa00e9c-aed8-4704-b429-b91d29e062ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b163a79ef7fa2ce6a70e169c90be5763, https://si.imgix.net/7047da0a/uploads/origins/2fa00e9c-aed8-4704-b429-b91d29e062ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fd7623902c88812b507a11e918540ed8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7047da0a/uploads/origins/2fa00e9c-aed8-4704-b429-b91d29e062ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d384c476d24bf2def1148748a7e00dde 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 2217313, "nc": 144}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 1070840, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4658f1b2d2bc31f2a419618c7a3f0f23", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4658f1b2d2bc31f2a419618c7a3f0f23, https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb3f5cf6b85a5ed53102f1b361b70c16 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08417191f2699ee8dc055225bee65fea 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1045cef8c47355dd197cfe9427850a1a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1045cef8c47355dd197cfe9427850a1a, https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10f4282a92cd51195132e25712a85b7f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d184048/uploads/origins/f37e1650-2486-4fe8-8c0b-ec666018a505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c5a0b491aa183eebabdd449ad5c7d4f5 3x"}, "body": "Thank you ARI for your beautiful work - I hope you will illustrate the story between these three next time!\n\nThe white-haired genie: a nice person who is easily angered. He is a friend of the red-haired genie and always can't help the other one.\n(Actually, in his heart, he has special feelings for the red-haired genie.)\n\nRed-haired Genie: The father of the red-haired girl is a doomed hero. Raised in a human village, he is a clever merchant, seemingly indifferent, but always doing amazing things.\n\nNarrative: since humans and spirits are not allowed to fall in love, the red-haired spirit and her daughter are hunted by the clan, and the red-haired spirit does not want either the spirit or the human to be harmed. She finally decided to seal herself off, give all her life span to her daughter, and then leave her daughter in the care of the white-haired spirit.\n\n\nRed-haired girl: half spirit, the child of a spirit and a human. Her mother died after she was born. Her father gave her all her lifetimes and then she is cared for by a white-haired spirit, who travels with her.\n\nScreens for reference: three people lying in a meadow full of little daisies/ treehouse life/ white-haired genie and girl on the run/ red-haired and white-haired genie making noise.\n\nCompositions of two or three of them, 黑白漫画/黑白插图 are welcome. Clothing can be changed freely. Please enjoy drawing!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ky5zXqbt6CZYa-IZH_oY2lEHGtC5gMcj", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 2002761, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2b0e82b/uploads/origins/eaf9fc2e-0586-4bfd-90e6-b52e53df1437?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=t