lease use the costume 2 free drawing!\nThank you so much for consideration.\nIt doesn't matter if you feel inappropriate, you can cancel this request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VZoDEhtFmxtA5BNpl0QZgjQteYSZWn2I", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 2158850, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeb84fff05da9debffbee4082edb1370", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeb84fff05da9debffbee4082edb1370, https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa05f0bb65306bcbcdcc7d4d51f2a06f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=872c9e610e53b0114ee59f5a5aecbf72 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=96c51b98295049118ff6ca0bf30bb684", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=96c51b98295049118ff6ca0bf30bb684, https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=529093d3ffeb793e7248309066522187 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab31b9c7/uploads/origins/36429610-75ba-450e-a5db-b6b788702a86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f3c7f9567751fcce389669cee266a32a 3x"}, "body": "Greetings, Mr. ARI. If you don't mind, I would like to ask you to take care of two of my self-created master-servants.\n\nThe blond boy is the main one. He is half vampire and half human. He has a lot of emotions, but he would never do anything to hurt the maid. I like old things, old-fashioned machines and gears, and Japanese food.\nThe light blue girl is my maid. She is a half-beast. She is innocent and cute. She loves the Lord and cakes. The two of them are not in love, but they are good friends.\nMay I leave the composition of the picture to you?\n\nI would appreciate your consideration.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/G8ziTmXh26icQuc26", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/702a2f23/uploads/origins/d29e53aa-4e04-4cdb-a802-4327e24569b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7e2b8b982d5732a1b3abc1f7458fc21", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/702a2f23/uploads/origins/d29e53aa-4e04-4cdb-a802-4327e24569b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7e2b8b982d5732a1b3abc1f7458fc21, https://si.imgix.net/702a2f23/uploads/origins/d29e53aa-4e04-4cdb-a802-4327e24569b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d866152549e16f788e48d44c3d2d6f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/702a2f23/uploads/origins/d29e53aa-4e04-4cdb-a802-4327e24569b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13c237a08869617ec5efd2c57176a9ad 3x"}, "duration": null, "n