form: 160\n-Right eye is relatively light in color.\n-He has glasses and double teeth.\n-Optimistic, always smiling\n-Occupation is a cram school teacher\n\nPurple eyes\n-Gender Male\n-Height Private: 178, Uniform: 170\n-Has earrings in both ears, the same number.\n-Deep dark circles in his eyes.\n-Gentle, silent\n-Occupation: professional chess player\n\nThey are lovers\n\nCostumes are free to choose and draw (you don't have to mask).\n\n\nPose and facial expressions are optional.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-Xsrg_emuwCFPR65MVAxwULEjSYruyHQ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/09788e49/uploads/origins/3b58bf60-9850-4593-86c5-d4dbb1d3e590?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a16ed421e9cd104549d1b9d072b1f808", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09788e49/uploads/origins/3b58bf60-9850-4593-86c5-d4dbb1d3e590?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a16ed421e9cd104549d1b9d072b1f808, https://si.imgix.net/09788e49/uploads/origins/3b58bf60-9850-4593-86c5-d4dbb1d3e590?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9a12d8c5b08fbb9be4905392cfdf5619 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09788e49/uploads/origins/3b58bf60-9850-4593-86c5-d4dbb1d3e590?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=851e9ae17644277b439f3779dd2bfbcc 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 2217313, "nc": 0}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 1070840, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37635cc318094ae03c64fd4227a10e13", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37635cc318094ae03c64fd4227a10e13, https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6340abe8dd5f44032eb35500151faf0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=781b66d55bb0f774620ed70b9b177e2e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=288f77d8c225baf6d51cd72852a7ccc2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=288f77d8c225baf6d51cd72852a7ccc2, https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1ec07005f1299ddd59f04caa19ab64d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a5478984/uploads/origins/b2fe5995-e841-4796-b4f8-8d2de5b802d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b4fd961716f81db71fc97230b832961 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I just wanted to let you know that I am very pleased with your work! I loved your beautiful work very much!\n\nI hope you can draw my original character!\n\n1. a gray-haired young man is the owner of a young manor. He is kind and patiently puts up with others, there is no great change in his countenance as he has made a deal with the dragon to save his city from being destroyed by the dragon and has given his soul.\n\n2. Another one with dark blue hair transforms from the dragon, loves to be with the white-haired manor owner. He accompanies the white-haired young man in the manor as a servant. These two are very happy in their life together, but their attitude towards any stranger is very indifferent.\n\nI like your work very much, so feel free to change the composition and clothing! Anyway, have fun painting them. They are very close and trust each other.\n\nI hope you can draw freely! (黑白は大欢迎です)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16c4rf4gPpKsw66PoNkEvN7dOPY2IfaYD", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@arii6160/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1913130, "client_id": 3133011, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b241b507fc9d5bacaa4cce5cba96a47d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b241b507fc9d5bacaa4cce5cba96a47d, https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d3f95938d005c0dbfacdae85f9f0f27 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b88c704d3f26c34f6bd7f476b772c55 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00c74d27eb4abe0efa84db40618b1787", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00c74d27eb4abe0efa84db40618b1787, https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be9c35593a61c9e75071581d12a52195 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4f2eae4/uploads/origins/4092873e-917f-4890-a91f-8555323432d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=75231f601d3bb21aec954b7cfce32027 3x"}, "body": "Hello ARI-sensei!\nI love ARI-sensei's illustrations so much that I definitely wanted to commission him someday! Thank you for giving me the opportunity!\nThis time I sent a request for you to draw my original character.\nI have sent you two materials for two people to be drawn if possible, but either one of them would be fine!\nIf the amount is insufficient or inconvenient, you can cancel this request.\n\nThe two characters I want you to draw are Satori and Nagira.\nThey have known each other since high school and now work together at an amusement park.\nNagira is the park manager and Satori is an employee.\nSatori suffers from hearing loss and is often helped by nagira.\n\nI will use the illustrations for personal use only.\nI may show them off on social networking sites, but I will post them in such a way that it is clear that they were drawn by Mr. ARI.\nI will leave the composition of the illustration and the facial expressions of the characters to Mr. ARI.\nWe hope you will consider our proposal!\n\nhttps://